    "answer": {
      "short": "$2x^2+\\dfrac{14}{3}x-\\dfrac56$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\left(2x-\\frac13\\right)\\left(x+\\frac52\\right)&=2x^2+5x-\\frac13x-\\frac56\\\\\\left(2x-\\frac13\\right)\\left(x+\\frac52\\right)&=2x^2+\\frac{14}{3}x-\\frac56.\\end{align*}$$",
